{"version":1,"content":"<p>自1999年問世以來，《咕嚕牛》一直是兒童書架上的經典讀物。該書插畫師Axel Scheffler在接受採訪時表示，他正嚴肅考慮起訴部分AI公司，理由是這些企業未經授權復刻他的作品，涉嫌侵犯版權。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/comic/1584444.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:57.243257+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:46:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.894062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.894062+00:00","content_hash":"0304c41fabe5b2d5390f032dfd74c5baad40be98aeb0cb01d6e981c8c5d91c6a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}